1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,602
There is a botanical garden inside this Las Vegas hotel.

2
00:00:03,652 --> 00:00:08,073
Fresh flower displays fill the atrium, and they change with the seasons.

3
00:00:08,123 --> 00:00:12,958
Step outside, and the fountains of Bellagio are three minutes away on foot.

4
00:00:13,008 --> 00:00:19,485
Guests call the pools huge, sparkling, and clean, in more than three hundred reviews.

5
00:00:19,535 --> 00:00:22,662
Seventeen restaurants. Fifty spa treatment rooms. One address.

6
00:00:22,712 --> 00:00:28,034
Guests score it nine point zero out of ten, from more than fifteen thousand reviews.

7
00:00:28,084 --> 00:00:32,884
Want my honest take? It is in the long video.
